### =========================================================================
### PresenSure REST Client Testing Script (Antigravity IDE)
### =========================================================================
### Usage:
### 1. Ensure backend is running: php artisan serve
### 2. Click "Send Request" above the "# @name login" block below.
###    The auth token is automatically extracted and injected into the subsequent requests.
### 3. Click "Send Request" above any request block to execute it.
### =========================================================================

### Global Variables
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api
@contentType = application/json
@userId = 2000-0001
@password = password
@departmentId = 1

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. Authenticate (Admin User)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/signin HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: application/json

{
    "user_id": "{{userId}}",
    "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Dynamic Token Assignment
@authToken = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. View Department Details (with Program & Department Student Counts)
### Department 1 is CCS (College of Computer Studies) holding BSIT (18 students)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/departments/{{departmentId}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. List All Programs (shows students_count for each program)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/programs HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. List All Active Departments (shows programs and student counts)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/departments HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json
